=== 2. synthetic positive control ===
Design (fixed before running): 3000 genes (the 1151 senescence-union names + 1849 SYNTH noise genes), 77 samples with the real ND/T2D labels,
10 randomly chosen union genes shifted +1.5 SD in T2D, all other genes pure noise (SD 0.5), covariates random and independent of status.
Pipeline = production nested_cv, 10-fold x 2 repeats. Pre-stated PASS: nested AUC >= 0.90 AND >= 8 of the top-10 stability genes are planted.
